244	// A person's claims, listed under their row newest first. One form per row adds a claim, or edits
245	// the claim whose editor is open (URL state `editClaim`, the claim's id). Amounts come from the
246	// server as strings with two decimals and are added up in whole cents, never as floats. A claim's
247	// status moves DRAFT -> OPEN -> SETTLED, or DRAFT/OPEN -> VOID; the server refuses any other change.
248	// Opening gives a claim the sheet's next number, which voiding clears; a draft has none.
249	// The user who opens a claim is recorded and may not settle it.
250	// Settling fixes a claim's due at the rate of that moment. A person's statement binds each of their
